# The vendored gregale binary lands in this directory at release time.
# The release.yml workflow cross-builds ./cmd/gregale for linux-amd64,
# stamps the version via -ldflags -X .../pkg/wire.Version, and commits
# it gzip-compressed as bin/gregale.gz: GitHub refuses files over
# 100 MB. src/cli.sh unpacks it and checks it against the release's
# SHA256SUMS, which is generated alongside and attached to the GitHub
# Release.
#
# This file is a placeholder so the directory is tracked in git.
